# Components — shadcn-svelte + runes

## UI kit

- **shadcn-svelte** in `src/lib/components/ui/`
- **Bits UI** primitives under the hood
- `cn()` from `src/lib/utils.ts` (tailwind-merge + clsx)

## Svelte 5 runes

- Component state: `$state`, `$derived`, `$props()`
- Shared client state: `.svelte.ts` modules (replaces Zustand)
- Avoid legacy `export let` / `$:` where runes are clearer

## Structure

- Page-specific components near routes or under `src/lib/components/<feature>/`
- Reuse `components/ui/*` primitives; do not fork button/card styles per page

## Icons

- `lucide-svelte` — same icon names as legacy `lucide-react`

## Charts

- **Charts:** `chart-theme.ts` palette. SVG donuts (`LoanTypePieChart.svelte`) and CSS ranking tracks (`CurrencyBarChart.svelte`). ApexCharts via `ApexChart.svelte` for cashflow only. Not Recharts.

## Accessibility

- shadcn-svelte provides labels and focus rings; verify icon-only buttons have `aria-label`.
